    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21320" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βώμιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
