				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτὰν πάρα βώμιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					183
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βώμιοι ἐσχάραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					274
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ἕδρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					992
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of a
